          "trailhead": "Narada Falls trailhead/parking",
          "trailheadDirection": "From the Nisqually entrance of Mount Rainier National Park, drive east on Paradise Road about 14.5 miles to the Narada Falls parking lot on the right. The road between Longmire and Paradise is gated overnight from late October through the winter.",
